compare-only-writable-hint = Leaves out the properties marked read-only. Useful when looking for a setting that could actually be changed.
compare-only-named-hint = Shows only what this program already knows by name, such as recLimit or palNtsc. Handy for looking things up — but it hides exactly the unknown entries that a search is usually about.
