compare-gaps-note = Unclaimed bytes are not spare room for new features. The settings store is read by the camera's own firmware, and a value takes effect only where that firmware asks for its property, so a byte written into a gap is a byte nobody reads. Adding an entry would move the whole data region and the camera would then read the wrong addresses.
